re_up": 17, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Surprising facts reveal only 4% of DSA members are actually working class.", "large_image": "Tsgg3aVEZbKLVene.png", "title": "Gosh, This Is WEIRD: You Won't Believe THIS Inconvenient Fact About DSA Members (Ok FINE, You Will)"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATC9LLRqa", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 29, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8761590, "raw_content": "The House of Representatives was controlled by the Democratic Party throughout the entire presidency of Ronald Reagan (1981\u20131989).\r\n\r\n...and they had it by a significant margin.\r\n\r\n51 seats the first two years \r\n103 seats the next \r\n71 seats the next \r\n81 seats his last two years\r\n\r\nHe did get the senate after his first two years, and that eventually led to swing of the house in the 90's but it lagged.\r\n\r\nReagan had very little ability to do anything without democrat support, so compromises were deemed necessary.\r\n\r\nYes, he fucked up agreeing/trusting them on immigration\r\n\r\nBut he did not intend to be hoodwinked by them, they are just dishonest assholes.\r\n\r\nThe whole country swung right because of Reagan, it took time, but it happened.\r\n\r\nTrump is doing the same thing, but it is a slow process....", "author": "zillat", "created": 1785773322026, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Tom916", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "I'm tired of the nonsense about Ronald Reagan on this site here is an important fact....", "last_comment_created": 1785786002415, "content": "<p>The House of Representatives was controlled by the Democratic Party throughout the entire presidency of Ronald Reagan (1981\u20131989).</p>\n<p>...and they had it by a significant margin.</p>\n<p>51 seats the first two years\n103 seats the next\n71 seats the next\n81 seats his last two years</p>\n<p>He did get the senate after his first two years, and that eventually led to swing of the house in the 90's but it lagged.</p>\n<p>Reagan had very little ability to do anything without democrat support, so compromises were deemed necessary.</p>\n<p>Yes, he fucked up agreeing/trusting them on immigration</p>\n<p>But he did not intend to be hoodwinked by them, they are just dishonest assholes.</p>\n<p>The whole country swung right because of Reagan, it took time, but it happened.</p>\n<p>Trump is doing the same thing, but it is a slow process....</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 8, "score_up": 29, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2083887813255204998", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9LLzPd", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8761711, "raw_content": "", "author": "2Scoops2Terms2Walls", "created": 1785777845240, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Fury_of_Descent", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC9LLzPd.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/i/status/2083887813255204998", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [],